    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> once per turn, you target a number of allies equal to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> bonus (minimum 1). Each targeted ally must be within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight. Each ally you target can take the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Withdraw\" title=\"Withdraw\">Withdraw</a> Action immediately as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a>. The normal rules for <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Withdrawing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Withdrawing\">Withdrawing</a> otherwise apply.",
